msgctxt "64"
msgid "Excuse me. Does Nakahara-san live here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"He does, but he's not in right now. Do you have some kind of business with "
"him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Oh, I just needed to speak with him for a moment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"In that case, he's actually at my house. I can take you to him if you'd "
"like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Wonderful. I would greatly appreciate it."
msgstr ""

